g, and reload speed while the wielder is in motion."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Tap the Trigger","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a7840da2970b4137a333fb187477dfe0.png","desc":"Grants a short period of increased stability and accuracy on initial trigger pull."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Destabilizing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/30edf77113d7d1d996fcc37b7ef2050b.png","desc":"Defeating a target creates a Void burst; hitting other targets with this burst makes them volatile and grants you Volatile Rounds for a short duration."},{"name":"Cascade Point","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/fd17b30233d244fc7115315633906f6a.png","desc":"Final blows or sustained precision hits with another weapon increase this weapon's rate of fire for a short duration."},{"name":"Harmony","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a3c1c5e1cb05adef7cf6af6602a0da0.png","desc":"Final blows with other weapons improve this weapon's damage and performance for a short duration."},{"name":"Target Lock","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/72be46e05195a95ae1307a684f68456b.png","desc":"Damage increases the longer this weapon remains on a target."},{"name":"High-Impact Reserves","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/33ed859a08f2ccf643a1ac3c7f201966.png","desc":"Rounds at the end of the magazine deal more damage."},{"name":"Celerity","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7c14d03c3278c2cc925ad50249a0c316.png","desc":"Increases weapon handling and reload speed. Gain the following effects while you are the last living member of your fireteam:\n• Increased target acquisition\n• Increased handling and reload speed\n• Reduced flinch from incoming fire"},{"name":"Adrenaline Junkie","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6f8bde03140b53e6dc583ada1aeaa51d.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage and handling from final blows with grenades or this weapon."},{"name":"Snapshot Sights","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ce16c9e2cbd73bb548af3e15bdfc7177.png","desc":"Faster time to aim down sights."},{"name":"Elemental Capacitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e455d94dcafdab7a0d5a850712908020.png","desc":"Increased stats based on the currently equipped Super.\n• [Solar] increases your reload speed.\n• [Arc] increases handling.\n• [Void] increases stability.\n• [Stasis] moderately controls recoil and increases movement speed when aiming down sights.\n• [Strand] increases airborne effectiveness."},{"name":"Golden Tricorn","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ad63f37f2513f56892e0ed20621f5dc.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant bonus damage. While this buff is active, grenade or melee kills of the same damage type greatly increase its damage and duration."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Alacrity","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c38aff78c3d2f91d47afa3ddb90acab6.png","desc":"Gain increased reload, stability, aim assist, and range when an ally is defeated. Bonus increases when multiple allies are dead at the same time or when you are running solo."},{"name":"One Quiet Moment","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5dee055d9ec357e47521bcf18e8d9b0f.png","desc":"Grants increased reload speed and handling when out of combat. Swords gain faster movement speed."},{"name":"Nadir Focus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/992ceb9c53b3e4c1b8b0aaa629630c80.png","desc":"Sustained fire increases accuracy and range. Increases lunge distance for Swords, and projectile velocity for Launchers."}]}],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[6,19,31,38],[6,17,31,38],[6,17,32,38],[6,20,31,38],[6,20,32,38],[8,17,32,38],[8,19,25,38],[8,19,31,38],[8,20,31,38],[8,20,32,38],[2,20,31,38],[2,20,32,38],[6,19,25,38],[6,19,32,38],[6,20,26,37],[6,20,26,38],[8,17,31,38],[8,19,25,37],[8,19,32,38],[8,20,25,38],[2,17,31,38],[2,17,32,38],[2,19,25,38],[2,19,34,38],[2,20,25,38],[2,20,3